1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,550
You say you're just a weight we carry

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:09,500
That we'd be lighter with you gone

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,600
That's the night talking, it isn't you

4
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:17,750
And it's had your voice too long

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:22,000
But who would sing the wrong words with me

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:26,120
To every stupid summer song

7
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:30,100
I know how it pulls you, it pulled at me too

8
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,720
Some days it still takes the light

9
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:38,300
But I'll sit with you there in the waiting room

10
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:41,900
Till they call your name tonight

11
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,650
Baby, join me in life

12
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:50,120
Just tonight, just tonight

13
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:54,800
Give me one more winter morning

14
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,800
Stay with me until it's light
